        { "text", text = "The Witherbark trolls (level 30-36) hold the villages in south-eastern Arathi and south of Hammerfall; every kind of them drops a |cOXP_LOOT_Witherbark Totem Stick|r about two times in five: you need ten. Then go to the Circle of Outer Binding (the outer one, not the Inner circle). Three elementals (level 33-39) stand around its middle stone: pull them one at a time and clear them first. Stand at the middle stone and use a totem stick; about ten seconds later the |cOXP_LOOT_Bolt Charged Bramble|r forms on the stone: click it. If you die before you pick it up, the bramble and the sticks are lost and you need ten more." },
