        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Eldrun Stormbreaker|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 30 |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Eldrun Stormbreaker|r, the shaman trainer in Ironforge, sends you to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Veyric Thunderhame|r in Arathi Highlands. Your level 30 air totems (Grounding, Nature Resistance) need the |cOXP_LOOT_Air Totem|r he gives." },
