        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Veyric Thunderhame|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Veyric Thunderhame|r camps in the hills just west of Hammerfall, the Horde town in the north-east of Arathi: mind its guards. Fly to Refuge Pointe and head north-east." },
