        { "text", text = "The Islander (Orgrimmar)" },
        { "text", text = "At 30, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sorek|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Valley of Honor|r sends you to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Klannoc Macleod|r on Fray Island in the Barrens." },
