        { "text", text = "The Islander (Thunder Bluff)" },
        { "text", text = "At 30, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Torm Ragetotem|r, the warrior trainer of Thunder Bluff, sends you to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Klannoc Macleod|r on Fray Island in the Barrens." },
