        { "text", text = "The Islander (Undercity)" },
        { "text", text = "At 30, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Baltus Fowler|r, a warrior trainer of the Undercity, sends you to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Klannoc Macleod|r on Fray Island in the Barrens." },
