      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon",
        { "text", text = "Fray Island" },
        { "text", text = "Fly to Ratchet and go south along the Merchant Coast. Fray Island lies offshore to the south-east: wade across on the shallow sand bar; off it the water is deep and fatigue sets in. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Klannoc Macleod|r stands by the arena." },
        { "goto", x = 68.62, y = 49.16, zone = "1413" },
        { "turnin", quest = 1718, text = "Turn in The Islander" },
        { "target", name = "Klannoc Macleod" },
        { "goto", x = 68.62, y = 49.16, zone = "1413" },
        { "accept", quest = 1719, text = "Accept The Affray" },
        { "target", name = "Klannoc Macleod" },
      },
      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon",
        { "text", text = "The Affray" },
        { "text", text = "You have 10 minutes. Eat and drink to full, then step onto the grate in the middle of the crowd: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Twiggy Flathead|r announces the challengers (level 26-27), who come one at a time, 15-20 seconds apart, and only while you stand near the grate. After each kill, step off the grate to eat or bandage; step back on when ready for the next. Six of them, then |cOXP_ENEMY_Big Will|r (level 33, not elite) walks out; he stays neutral until you attack him, so bandage or eat first. Do not use Demoralizing Shout: it sends the challengers running and more of them pile in at once. If nothing starts, step off and on the grate again, or abandon the quest and take it again." },
        { "goto", x = 68.6, y = 48.7, zone = "1413" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 1719, text = "Kill Big Will: 1" },
        { "mob", name = "Big Will" },
        { "goto", x = 68.62, y = 49.16, zone = "1413" },
        { "turnin", quest = 1719, text = "Turn in The Affray (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Klannoc Macleod|r: Berserker Stance)" },
        { "target", name = "Klannoc Macleod" },
        { "goto", x = 68.62, y = 49.16, zone = "1413" },
        { "accept", quest = 1791, text = "Accept The Windwatcher" },
        { "target", name = "Klannoc Macleod" },
      },
      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bath'rah the Windwatcher|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bath'rah the Windwatcher|r camps by ruins on the east bank of the river that runs past Tarren Mill, a short walk north-east of the town, just over the border in Alterac Mountains; his cauldron stands beside him. Horde: fly to Tarren Mill. Alliance: fly to Southshore and go north along the river; Tarren Mill's guards are level 42 elites, so keep away from the town. Accepting Cyclonian gives you |cOXP_LOOT_Bath'rah's Parchment|r, the list of what he needs: 8 |cOXP_LOOT_Liferoot|r, 30 Bloodscalp Tusks and the |cOXP_LOOT_Essence of the Exile|r from his cauldron. The cauldron's |cOXP_LOOT_Essence of the Exile|r is not a quest you take: it never shows in your quest log. Come back with its charms and hand them in at the cauldron." },
        { "goto", x = 80.5, y = 66.92, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 1791, text = "Turn in The Windwatcher" },
        { "target", name = "Bath'rah the Windwatcher" },
        { "goto", x = 80.5, y = 66.92, zone = "1416" },
        { "accept", quest = 1712, text = "Accept Cyclonian" },
        { "target", name = "Bath'rah the Windwatcher" },
      },
      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_LOOT_Liferoot|r" },
        { "text", text = "You need 8 |cOXP_LOOT_Liferoot|r. Herbalists pick it by rivers and lakes in the Wetlands, Arathi Highlands and Stranglethorn Vale; otherwise the auction house. Herb vendors keep only one at a time and restock every two hours: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bernard Gump|r and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Maria Lumere|r in Stormwind, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Antonio Perelli|r on the road in eastern Elwynn, Jeeda at Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon, Montarr in Thousand Needles. Kurzen Medicine Men in northern Stranglethorn drop one about one kill in twelve." },
        { "goto", x = 77.21, y = 64.4, zone = "1416" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 1712, text = "Liferoot: 8" },
      },
      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon",
        { "text", text = "Bloodscalp Tusks" },
        { "text", text = "You need 30 tusks. Every Bloodscalp troll (level 33-37) of north-west Stranglethorn drops one about one kill in three, so plan on some 80 kills: the camps and ruins north and north-west of Grom'gol Base Camp and around the Bal'lal Ruins on the coast. They enrage below 30% health and the Warriors disarm; back in 5 minutes." },
        { "goto", x = 32.26, y = 17.17, zone = "1434" },
        { "complete", obj = 2, quest = 1712, text = "Bloodscalp Tusk: 30" },
        { "mob", name = "Bloodscalp Warrior" },
        { "mob", name = "Bloodscalp Scout" },
        { "mob", name = "Bloodscalp Hunter" },
      },
      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon",
        { "text", text = "The exiles of Arathi" },
        { "text", text = "The cauldron wants 8 of each charm, 24 in all, and each exile drops its charm about one kill in three, so plan on some 70 kills. All are level 38-39, not elite: the guide waits for level 37 first, and a friend helps. Burning Exiles (fire) by the Circle of West Binding in the north-west, north-west of Refuge Pointe; Thundering Exiles (air) by the Circle of Outer Binding south-east of Refuge Pointe, casting Lightning Bolt from 40 yards; Cresting Exiles (water) by the Circle of East Binding, north-west of Hammerfall, with Frost Nova. About a dozen of each, back in under 7 minutes. The charms trade and sell on the auction house; using one banishes another kind of exile for a while (Burning on Thundering, Thundering on Cresting, Cresting on Burning)." },
        { "xp", level = 37, text = "Reach level 37" },
        { "goto", x = 25.61, y = 30.4, zone = "1417" },
        { "collect", count = 8, item = 4479, text = "Burning Charm: 8 (|cOXP_LOOT_Burning Charm|r, from Burning Exiles)" },
        { "goto", x = 50.39, y = 50.83, zone = "1417" },
        { "collect", count = 8, item = 4480, text = "Thundering Charm: 8 (|cOXP_LOOT_Thundering Charm|r, from Thundering Exiles)" },
        { "goto", x = 65.36, y = 31.01, zone = "1417" },
        { "collect", count = 8, item = 4481, text = "Cresting Charm: 8 (|cOXP_LOOT_Cresting Charm|r, from Cresting Exiles)" },
      },
      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon",
        { "text", text = "Essence of the Exile" },
        { "text", text = "Click |cOXP_PICK_Bath'rah's Cauldron|r with the 24 charms in your bags and Cyclonian in your log. Its window asks for the charms straight away, with nothing to accept: Continue, then Complete, and it hands you the Essence of the Exile." },
        { "goto", x = 79.32, y = 66.8, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 1714, text = "Turn in Essence of the Exile (|cOXP_PICK_Bath'rah's Cauldron|r: Essence of the Exile)" },
        { "goto", x = 80.5, y = 66.9, zone = "1416" },
        { "complete", obj = 3, quest = 1712, text = "Essence of the Exile: 1 (Essence of the Exile, from the cauldron by |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bath'rah the Windwatcher|r)" },
      },
      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon",
        { "text", text = "The Summoning" },
        { "text", text = "Back to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bath'rah the Windwatcher|r. Accepting The Summoning starts his ritual, and Cyclonian appears just north of his camp. Cyclonian is elite (level 40): grouping up is encouraged; it needs a group of two or three around level 40. It deals nature damage (a |cOXP_LOOT_Nature Protection Potion|r soaks it), whirls, and Knock Away throws you far while it heals itself as you run back: fight with your back to a slope or rock. The |cOXP_LOOT_Whirlwind Heart|r always drops. If the fight fails |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bath'rah the Windwatcher|r stops answering: abandon The Summoning and take it again for a new summon; the earlier items are not needed again." },
        { "goto", x = 80.5, y = 66.92, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 1712, text = "Turn in Cyclonian" },
        { "target", name = "Bath'rah the Windwatcher" },
        { "xp", level = 38, text = "Reach level 38" },
