      { only = "Mage", source = "polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb",
        { "text", text = "Tabetha's Task (optional)" },
        { "text", text = "At 40 the mage trainers who send you to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Jennea Cannon|r, Bink, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Anastasia Hartwell|r, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Deino|r) also have Tabetha's Task, a quest any class can do. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r then wants the Tiara of the Deep from |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Hydromancer Velratha|r, a level 46 elite naga in Zul'Farrak, the troll dungeon in north-western Tanaris: a group of five, level 44-54. The reward window shows the |cOXP_LOOT_Spellshifter Rod|r and the |cOXP_LOOT_Gemshale Pauldrons|r." },
