        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_LOOT_Orb of Dar'Orahil|r" },
        { "text", text = "Back to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Menara Voidrender|r in the tower above Ratchet with the cleansed orb. On the felhound path, accept her last quest and wait beside her while she completes the |cOXP_LOOT_Orb of Dar'Orahil|r (do not attack her: the quest log calls it a kill), then speak to her again and pick the off-hand orb or the staff." },
